# Keeps the build context small AND stops anything that must never reach
# the image (real secrets, local dev env values, git history) from ever
# being COPYable in the first place -- deploy/Dockerfile's build stage
# also explicitly deletes any web/.env* it finds after `COPY . .`, as a
# second, independent guard against the same mistake (see that file's
# comment on why: Next's standalone output copies `.env*` files verbatim).
.git
.superpowers
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
.next
**/.next
coverage
**/coverage
secrets
.env
.env.*
*.tsbuildinfo
